graph TB
    subgraph Host["KFP Component Pod (pipelines-components AutoRAG, runs in Data Science Pipelines / Argo)"]
        Wrapper["@dsl.component wrapper<br/>artifact I/O, secrets → env vars"]

        subgraph Lib["ai4rag library v0.26.0 (in-process, no listeners)"]
            Experiment["AI4RAGExperiment<br/>(ai4rag.core.experiment)"]
            MPS["ModelsPreSelector<br/>(MPS)"]
            HPO["HPO Optimizers<br/>GAMOptimizer (pyGAM) / RandomOptimizer"]
            SearchSpace["Search Space<br/>params, constraints, model discovery"]
            Chunking["Chunking<br/>DoclingChunker / LangChainChunker"]
            Models["Embedding + Foundation Models<br/>(openai SDK wrappers)"]
            VS["Vector Store Abstraction<br/>Milvus / Milvus Lite / pgvector / Neo4j<br/>+ reranker, from_env() configs"]
            Retrieval["Retrieval<br/>simple / window / LLMDocumentCompressor"]
            Template["RAG Templates<br/>AgenticRAG (LangChain ChatOpenAI) / SequentialRAG"]
            Evaluator["Evaluators<br/>LLM-as-a-judge / RAGAS / unitxt"]
            Clients["Clients<br/>create_maas_client / create_s3_client"]
            Data["Data Utils<br/>S3 discovery, Docling extraction<br/>OCR (RapidOCR/ONNX) + Whisper ASR<br/>spawn multiprocessing pool"]
            Events["Event Handlers<br/>KFPEventHandler (memory) / LocalEventHandler (JSON files)"]
            Network["Network Trust Policy<br/>ensure_safe_url, is_local_or_cluster_host"]
        end
    end

    Wrapper -->|imports / invokes| Experiment
    Wrapper -->|extract_text / prepare_extraction| Data
    Experiment -->|1. pre-select models| MPS
    Experiment -->|2. drive search| HPO
    HPO -->|samples| SearchSpace
    Experiment -->|3a. chunk corpus| Chunking
    Experiment -->|3b. index per-iteration collection| VS
    VS -->|embeds via| Models
    Experiment -->|3c. answer benchmark Qs| Template
    Template -->|retrieves| Retrieval
    Retrieval -->|queries| VS
    Template -->|generates via| Models
    Experiment -->|3d. score answers| Evaluator
    Evaluator -->|judge model| Models
    Experiment -->|4. publish status / patterns| Events
    Models -->|uses| Clients
    Data -->|uses| Clients
    Clients -.->|validated by| Network
    VS -.->|validated by| Network

    Events -->|patterns, evaluations, conversations| Wrapper

    MaaS["Models-as-a-Service<br/>(OpenAI-compatible)"]
    S3["S3-compatible Storage<br/>(data connection)"]
    Stores["Milvus / pgvector / Neo4j"]
    HF["Hugging Face Hub<br/>(connected mode only)"]

    Clients -->|HTTPS/443 Bearer| MaaS
    Clients -->|HTTPS/443 SigV4| S3
    VS -->|gRPC / PG wire / Bolt| Stores
    Data -.->|HTTPS/443 pinned models| HF

